msgid "I have read the judging rubric carefully and will apply it as written."
msgstr "我已仔细阅读评分标准，并将严格按照标准评审。"

msgid ""
"I have no significant personal beliefs on any essay question that would "
"hinder my ability to judge fairly, other than those I have declared below."
msgstr "除下方已申明的题目外，我对任何征文题目都没有会妨碍我公正评审的强烈个人立场。"

msgid "Essay questions on which I hold significant personal beliefs"
