msgstr "委员会备注"

msgid "— not set —"
msgstr "— 未设置 —"

msgid "— not recorded —"
msgstr "— 未登记 —"

msgid "Judged in"
msgstr "参评组别"

msgid ""
"Follows the prompt: an essay answering Prompts IV–VI is judged in the "
"undergraduate category even if a high school student wrote it."
msgstr "随题目而定：回答题目 IV–VI 的文章在本科组参评，即使作者是高中生。"

msgid "Contest name"
msgstr "比赛名称"

msgid "Contact address shown to judges"
msgstr "向评委显示的联系邮箱"

msgid "Essay word limit"
msgstr "文章字数上限"

msgid "Judging deadline"
msgstr "评审截止时间"

msgid "Re-score deadline"
msgstr "复评截止时间"

msgid "Send reminders this many days before a deadline"
msgstr "在截止日期前多少天发送提醒"

msgid "Human readers per essay"
msgstr "每篇文章的人工评委人数"

msgid "Divergence threshold (points)"
msgstr "分歧阈值（分）"

msgid "Final score when an essay has been re-scored"
msgstr "文章经复评后的最终得分"

msgid "Minimum words of justification"
msgstr "评语最少词数"

msgid "Invitation links expire after (days)"
msgstr "邀请链接有效期（天）"

msgid "Comma-separated, for example 3,1. Leave empty to send none."
msgstr "用逗号分隔，例如 3,1。留空则不发送提醒。"

msgid ""
"An essay is flagged for re-scoring when the gap between any two readers' "
"average scores is at least this large."
msgstr "当任意两位评委的平均分差距达到或超过该值时，文章将被标记为需要复评。"

msgid ""
"When empty, the judging deadline applies until it has passed; after that re-"
"scores have no deadline."
msgstr "留空时，在评审截止时间之前沿用该截止时间；截止时间过后，复评不设截止时间。"

msgid "Use whole numbers separated by commas."
msgstr "请使用以逗号分隔的整数。"

msgid "Use steps of 0.5."
msgstr "请以 0.5 为单位。"

msgid "The PDF is password-protected."
msgstr "该 PDF 设有密码保护。"

#, python-format
msgid "The PDF has more than %(n)s pages."
msgstr "该 PDF 超过 %(n)s 页。"

msgid "The PDF contains far more text than an essay."
msgstr "该 PDF 的文本量远超一篇文章。"

msgid "The PDF took too long or too much memory to process."
msgstr "处理该 PDF 耗时过长或占用内存过多。"

msgid "The file is not a readable PDF."
msgstr "该文件不是可读取的 PDF。"

msgid "there are no pages left to release"
msgstr "没有可发放的页面"

msgid ""
"another upload has the same file name, so the author on record may be wrong "
"(open the essay, check the author details and save them)"
msgstr "另有一份上传文件与其同名，登记的作者可能有误（请打开文章，核对并保存作者信息）"

msgid "the author’s full name is still on the pages"
msgstr "页面上仍有作者的全名"

msgid "the author’s email address is still on the pages"
msgstr "页面上仍有作者的邮箱地址"

msgid "an email address is still on the pages"
msgstr "页面上仍有邮箱地址"

msgid "the author’s school is still on the pages"
msgstr "页面上仍有作者的学校"

msgid ""
"this PDF has little or no readable text (it may be a scan), so nothing could"
" be checked automatically"
msgstr "该 PDF 几乎没有可读取的文本（可能是扫描件），因此无法自动检查"

