msgstr "保存"

msgid "Passkeys"
msgstr "通行密钥"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "Added"
msgstr "添加时间"

msgid "Last used"
msgstr "最近使用"

msgid "Passkey"
msgstr "通行密钥"

msgid "Remove this passkey? You will no longer be able to sign in with it."
msgstr "移除这个通行密钥？此后将无法再用它登录。"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgid ""
"A passkey lets you sign in with your fingerprint, face or device PIN instead"
" of a password. Add one on each device you judge on."
msgstr "通行密钥让您用指纹、面容或设备 PIN 登录，无需密码。请在您评审时使用的每台设备上各添加一个。"

msgid "Add a passkey on this device"
msgstr "在此设备上添加通行密钥"

msgid "This browser cannot create passkeys."
msgstr "此浏览器无法创建通行密钥。"

msgid "Change password"
msgstr "修改密码"

msgid "Add a password"
msgstr "添加密码"

msgid ""
"You sign in with a passkey. A password is optional; it gives you a second "
"way in."
msgstr "您目前使用通行密钥登录。密码是可选的，可作为另一种登录方式。"

msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "重置密码"

msgid ""
"This server cannot send email. Ask a committee administrator to generate a "
"reset link for you."
msgstr "本服务器无法发送邮件。请联系委员会管理员为您生成重置链接。"

msgid ""
"If that address belongs to an account, a reset link is on its way. It "
"expires in 24 hours."
msgstr "如果该邮箱已注册账号，重置链接已发出，24 小时内有效。"

msgid "Enter the email address you sign in with and we will send you a link."
msgstr "请输入您登录所用的邮箱，我们会向您发送链接。"

msgid "Send reset link"
msgstr "发送重置链接"

msgid "Back to sign in"
msgstr "返回登录"

msgid "Link no longer valid"
msgstr "链接已失效"

msgid "This link is no longer valid"
msgstr "该链接已失效"

msgid ""
"Invitation links work once and expire. If you have already created your "
"account, sign in instead. Otherwise ask the committee to send a new "
"invitation."
msgstr "邀请链接只能使用一次，且有有效期。如果您已创建账号，请直接登录；否则请联系委员会重新发送邀请。"

msgid ""
"Password reset links work once and expire after 24 hours. Request a new one."
msgstr "密码重置链接只能使用一次，24 小时后失效。请重新申请。"

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "登录"

msgid "Sign in with a passkey"
msgstr "使用通行密钥登录"

msgid "or with your password"
msgstr "或使用密码登录"

msgid "Can’t sign in?"
msgstr "无法登录？"

msgid ""
"Accounts are created by invitation. If you are a judge and have not received"
" a link, contact the committee."
msgstr "账号仅通过邀请创建。如果您是评委但尚未收到链接，请联系委员会。"

msgid "Set up your sign-in"
msgstr "设置登录方式"

#, python-format
msgid "Welcome, %(name)s"
msgstr "欢迎您，%(name)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Choose how you will sign in as %(email)s."
msgstr "请选择以 %(email)s 登录的方式。"

msgid "Set up your sign-in again"
msgstr "重新设置登录方式"

msgid "Create a new passkey or choose a new password."
msgstr "创建新的通行密钥，或设置新密码。"

msgid "Use a passkey"
msgstr "使用通行密钥"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "推荐"

msgid ""
"Sign in with your fingerprint, face or device PIN. There is no password to "
"remember, and it cannot be guessed or phished. Use the device you will judge"
" on."
msgstr "用指纹、面容或设备 PIN 登录。无需记住密码，也无法被猜出或被钓鱼网站骗取。请在您评审时使用的设备上操作。"

msgid "Create a passkey"
msgstr "创建通行密钥"

msgid "or use a password"
msgstr "或使用密码"

msgid ""
"This browser cannot create passkeys, so choose a password. (If you opened "
"this link inside another app, opening it in Safari, Chrome or Edge may offer"
" passkeys.)"
msgstr ""
"此浏览器无法创建通行密钥，请设置密码。（如果您是在其他应用内打开此链接，改用 Safari、Chrome 或 Edge 打开可能会支持通行密钥。）"

msgid ""
"At least 10 characters. Avoid common passwords and anything based on your "
"name or email."
msgstr "至少 10 个字符。请避免使用常见密码，以及与您的姓名或邮箱相关的内容。"

msgid "Create account with a password"
msgstr "用密码创建账号"

msgid "Save password"
