msgstr "已标出，未遮盖"

msgid "Before release"
msgstr "发放前须处理"

msgid ""
"Pull this essay back? Judges will not see it until you release it again."
msgstr "收回这篇文章？在您再次发放之前，评委将无法看到它。"

msgid "Pull back from judges"
msgstr "从评委处收回"

msgid "Release to judges"
msgstr "发放给评委"

msgid ""
"Release anyway: I have checked the pages myself and the warning above is a "
"false alarm"
msgstr "照常发放：我已亲自检查各页，上述警告属于误报"

msgid "Redact a word everywhere"
msgstr "全文遮盖某个词"

msgid "Word or phrase"
msgstr "词或短语"

msgid "Redact"
msgstr "遮盖"

msgid ""
"Finds it on every page. For anything the search cannot find (a logo, a "
"signature, a scan), drag a box over it."
msgstr "在每一页上查找。对于搜索无法找到的内容（徽标、签名、扫描件），请拖动绘制方框将其盖住。"

msgid "Checklist"
msgstr "检查清单"

msgid ""
"Nothing was found automatically. Still look over the first and last pages."
msgstr "没有自动找到任何内容。但仍请查看第一页和最后一页。"

msgid "Author on record"
msgstr "登记的作者信息"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "姓名"

msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

msgid "File properties"
msgstr "文件属性"

msgid "Edit author details"
msgstr "编辑作者信息"

msgid ""
"Start the automatic redaction again? Your own boxes will be removed and the "
"essay will be pulled back from judges until you release it again."
msgstr "重新开始自动遮盖？您自己添加的方框将被移除，文章也会从评委处收回，直到您再次发放。"

msgid "Start the automatic redaction again? Your own boxes will be removed."
msgstr "重新开始自动遮盖？您自己添加的方框将被移除。"

msgid "Start automatic redaction again"
msgstr "重新开始自动遮盖"

msgid "Contest"
msgstr "比赛"

msgid "From the contest website"
msgstr "来自比赛网站"

msgid ""
"For reference only. The judging deadline below is separate and is yours to "
"set; it should fall after the last date on which essays can arrive."
msgstr "仅供参考。下方的评审截止时间与此无关，由您自行设定；应晚于文章可能送达的最后日期。"

msgid "Deadlines and reminders"
msgstr "截止时间与提醒"

#, python-format
msgid "Times are in %(time_zone)s"
msgstr "时间以 %(time_zone)s 时区为准"

msgid ""
"Email is not configured on this server, so reminders will not be delivered."
msgstr "本服务器未配置邮件，因此提醒不会送达。"

msgid "Scoring rules"
msgstr "评分规则"

msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "邀请"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Links in emails point to %(site_url)s. This is set by SITE_URL on the "
"server."
msgstr "邮件中的链接指向 %(site_url)s。该地址由服务器上的 SITE_URL 设置。"

msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "保存设置"

msgid "Judging sheet"
msgstr "评分表"

msgid ""
"Reopen this sheet so the judge can change and resubmit it? Its scores stop "
"counting until then."
msgstr "重新开放这份评分表，让评委修改后再次提交？在此之前其分数不计入结果。"

msgid "Reopen for the judge"
msgstr "为评委重新开放"

msgid "The judge has not started this sheet."
msgstr "评委尚未开始填写这份评分表。"

msgid ""
"This is a draft. It has not been submitted and does not count towards the "
"result."
msgstr "这是草稿，尚未提交，不计入结果。"

msgid "Flags and confirmation"
msgstr "标记与确认"

msgid "Yes,No"
msgstr "是,否"

msgid ""
"Nothing uploaded here is visible to judges until you have reviewed and "
"released it."
msgstr "在您审核并发放之前，这里上传的任何内容评委都看不到。"

msgid "Author spreadsheet"
msgstr "作者信息表"

msgid ""
"Upload the spreadsheet of submissions first. Knowing each author’s name, "
"school and email lets the portal redact them reliably, and fills in the "
"prompt for you."
msgstr "请先上传投稿信息表。掌握每位作者的姓名、学校和邮箱后，系统才能可靠地将其遮盖，并自动填入题目。"

msgid ""
"Essays arrive by email with whatever file name the contestant chose, and "
"every essay starts with a cover page. Give each PDF a unique name before "
"uploading (a submission number works well), and list that name in the "
"spreadsheet. The cover page is left out automatically."
msgstr ""
"文章通过电子邮件提交，文件名由参赛者自定，且每篇文章都以封面页开头。上传前请为每个 PDF "
"起一个唯一的文件名（例如投稿编号），并在信息表中填写该文件名。封面页会被自动排除。"

msgid ""
"CSV or XLSX with a header row. Required column: <span "
"class=\"mono\">filename</span>. Optional: <span class=\"mono\">name</span>, "
"<span class=\"mono\">email</span>, <span class=\"mono\">school</span>, <span"
" class=\"mono\">division</span> (whether the author is a high school or "
"undergraduate student), <span class=\"mono\">prompt</span> (I–VI, a number, "
"or the theme). Rows are matched to essay files by file name; you can re-"
"import at any time. An essay is judged in the category of its prompt, "
"whatever the author’s level."
msgstr ""
"带表头的 CSV 或 XLSX 文件。必需列：<span class=\"mono\">filename</span>。可选列：<span "
"class=\"mono\">name</span>、<span class=\"mono\">email</span>、<span "
"class=\"mono\">school</span>、<span "
"class=\"mono\">division</span>（作者是高中生还是本科生）、<span "
"class=\"mono\">prompt</span>（I–VI、数字或主题）。各行按文件名与文章文件匹配；您可以随时重新导入。无论作者身份如何，文章都在其题目所属的组别参评。"

msgid "Import"
msgstr "导入"

#, python-format
msgid "%(records)s author records on file."
msgstr "已登记 %(records)s 条作者信息。"

msgid "Finished."
msgstr "已完成。"

msgid "Uploading"
msgstr "正在上传"

msgid "Upload failed — try this file again."
msgstr "上传失败——请重新上传此文件。"

msgid "Essay files"
msgstr "文章文件"

msgid ""
"Used for files that have no row in the author spreadsheet. You can change "
"either later."
msgstr "用于作者信息表中没有对应行的文件。两项都可以稍后修改。"

msgid "Drop PDF files here"
msgstr "将 PDF 文件拖放到这里"

#, python-format
msgid "or choose them below · up to %(max_mb)s MB each"
msgstr "或在下方选择文件 · 每个文件不超过 %(max_mb)s MB"

msgid "Go to anonymization review"
msgstr "前往匿名化审核"

msgid "What happens to each file"
msgstr "每个文件的处理流程"

msgid ""
"Each page is turned into an image. The file itself, its name and its "
"document properties are never shown to judges."
msgstr "每一页都会转换为图像。文件本身、文件名及其文档属性绝不会显示给评委。"

msgid ""
"A title page is left out, and black boxes are placed over the author’s name "
"and school, emails, phone numbers, and running headers that carry the name."
msgstr "标题页会被排除，并在作者的姓名和学校、邮箱、电话号码以及带有姓名的页眉上加盖黑框。"

msgid ""
"The essay gets a random ID and waits in the review queue, where you check "
"the pages, adjust the boxes and release it."
msgstr "文章获得一个随机编号并进入审核队列，由您检查页面、调整方框后发放。"

msgid ""
"Scanned PDFs work too, but nothing can be found in them automatically: you "
"draw the boxes yourself."
msgstr "扫描版 PDF 也可以使用，但无法从中自动查找任何内容：需要您自己绘制方框。"

msgid "Signed"
msgstr "已签署"

msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

msgid "Ask this judge to sign the statement again?"
msgstr "要求这位评委重新签署声明？"

msgid "Require re-signing"
msgstr "要求重新签署"

msgid "Not signed yet. The judge cannot open essays until it is."
msgstr "尚未签署。签署之前评委无法打开文章。"

msgid "No essays assigned."
msgstr "尚未分配文章。"

msgid ""
"Release every unfinished assignment this judge holds? Draft scores will be "
"discarded from the results."
msgstr "释放这位评委所有未完成的分配？草稿分数将不计入结果。"

#, python-format
msgid "Release %(pending_count)s unfinished assignments"
msgstr "释放 %(pending_count)s 项未完成的分配"

msgid "Use this when a judge drops out, then run auto-assign."
msgstr "评委退出时使用此功能，然后运行自动分配。"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "详细信息"

msgid "Access"
msgstr "访问权限"

msgid "Last sign-in"
msgstr "最近登录"

msgid "Signs in with"
msgstr "登录方式"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s passkey"
msgid_plural "%(n)s passkeys"
msgstr[0] "%(n)s 个通行密钥"

msgid "a password"
msgstr "密码"

msgid "Create a new sign-in link"
msgstr "创建新的登录链接"

msgid ""
"For someone who has lost their device or forgotten their password. It lets "
"them create a new passkey or password."
msgstr "适用于丢失设备或忘记密码的人。对方可通过该链接创建新的通行密钥或密码。"

msgid "Send a new invitation"
msgstr "重新发送邀请"

msgid ""
"Remove every passkey this person has? Do this if a device was lost or "
"stolen."
msgstr "移除此人的全部通行密钥？设备丢失或被盗时请执行此操作。"

msgid "Remove their passkeys"
msgstr "移除其通行密钥"

msgid "Deactivate account"
msgstr "停用账号"

msgid "Reactivate account"
msgstr "重新启用账号"

msgid ""
"People join by invitation only. Each invitation is a one-time link with "
"which they set up their own sign-in: a passkey or a password."
msgstr "成员只能通过邀请加入。每份邀请都是一次性链接，受邀者通过它自行设置登录方式：通行密钥或密码。"

msgid "No judges yet. Invite the first one with the form on this page."
msgstr "尚无评委。请用本页的表单邀请第一位评委。"

msgid "Administrators"
msgstr "管理员"

msgid ""
"Administrators can see author identities and every score. They are not "
"assigned essays."
msgstr "管理员可以看到作者身份和所有评分。系统不会向管理员分配文章。"

msgid "Invite someone"
msgstr "邀请成员"

msgid "Send invitation"
msgstr "发送邀请"

msgid "Create invitation"
msgstr "创建邀请"

msgid ""
"You will get the invitation as a ready-written message to send from your own"
" email."
msgstr "系统会生成一封写好的邀请邮件，由您用自己的邮箱发送。"

#, python-format
msgid "Author’s full name: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "作者全名：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Name from the file’s properties: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "文件属性中的姓名：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "School name: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "学校名称：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Email addresses: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "邮箱地址：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Phone numbers: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "电话号码：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Labelled identity lines (“Name: …”): %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "带标签的身份信息行（“Name: …”）：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Repeating page header or footer: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "重复出现的页眉或页脚：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Words you asked to redact everywhere: %(n)s box(es)"
msgstr "您要求全文遮盖的词语：%(n)s 个方框"

#, python-format
msgid "Boxes you drew: %(n)s"
msgstr "您绘制的方框：%(n)s 个"

#, python-format
msgid "Pages left out (title page): %(pages)s"
msgstr "已排除的页面（标题页）：%(pages)s"

msgid ""
"No author name on record, so the name could only be found by pattern. Import"
" the author spreadsheet or look over every page closely."
msgstr "没有登记作者姓名，只能依靠规则查找姓名。请导入作者信息表，或仔细查看每一页。"

msgid ""
"The author name on record is too long to match automatically. Shorten it to "
"the person’s actual name, or redact by hand."
msgstr "登记的作者姓名过长，无法自动匹配。请改为作者的真实姓名，或手动遮盖。"

msgid ""
"This PDF has little or no readable text (it may be a scan). Nothing could be"
" found automatically: draw boxes over anything identifying yourself."
msgstr "该 PDF 几乎没有可读取的文本（可能是扫描件）。无法自动查找任何内容：请自行在任何可能透露身份的内容上绘制方框。"

msgid ""
"Another upload has the same file name. Author records are matched by file "
"name, so check by hand that the author shown here is really this essay’s "
"author."
msgstr "另有一份上传文件与其同名。作者信息按文件名匹配，因此请人工核对此处显示的作者确实是本文作者。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"“%(term)s” (part of the author’s name) appears %(n)s time(s) — outlined"
msgstr "“%(term)s”（作者姓名的一部分）出现 %(n)s 次——已标出"

#, python-format
msgid "“%(term)s” (from the school name) appears %(n)s time(s) — outlined"
msgstr "“%(term)s”（来自学校名称）出现 %(n)s 次——已标出"

#, python-format
msgid "Possible self-identifying statement: %(n)s — outlined"
msgstr "可能透露身份的自述：%(n)s 处——已标出"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Repeating page header or footer without the author’s name: %(n)s — outlined"
msgstr "不含作者姓名的重复页眉或页脚：%(n)s 处——已标出"

msgid ""
"The author is recorded as an undergraduate but answered a high school prompt"
" (I–III). The rules limit undergraduates to Prompts IV–VI."
msgstr "作者登记为本科生，但回答的是高中组题目（I–III）。按规则，本科生只能回答题目 IV–VI。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"About %(n)s words on the pages; the limit is %(limit)s. The count includes "
"footnotes, references and headers, so check before acting on it."
msgstr "页面上约有 %(n)s 词；上限为 %(limit)s。该计数包含脚注、参考文献和页眉，请核实后再作处理。"

msgid "Acknowledgements section — may name teachers or family"
msgstr "致谢部分——可能提及老师或家人的姓名"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Too many failed attempts. Please wait %(minutes)s minutes and try again."
msgstr "失败次数过多。请等待 %(minutes)s 分钟后再试。"

msgid "The email or password is not correct."
msgstr "邮箱或密码不正确。"

msgid "Welcome. Your account is ready."
msgstr "欢迎！您的账号已就绪。"

msgid "Your password has been changed. Please sign in."
msgstr "密码已修改，请登录。"

msgid "Your password has been changed."
msgstr "密码已修改。"

msgid ""
"This is your only way to sign in. Add another passkey or set a password "
"before removing it."
msgstr "这是您唯一的登录方式。请先添加另一个通行密钥或设置密码，再移除它。"

msgid "Passkey removed."
msgstr "通行密钥已移除。"

msgid "Your details have been saved."
msgstr "个人信息已保存。"

msgid "Passkey added."
msgstr "通行密钥已添加。"

msgid "Thank you. You can now begin judging."
msgstr "谢谢！您现在可以开始评审了。"

#, python-format
msgid "Score every criterion. Missing: %(list)s."
msgstr "请为每项标准评分。尚缺：%(list)s。"

#, python-format
msgid "Write a justification for every criterion. Missing: %(list)s."
msgstr "请为每项标准撰写评语。尚缺：%(list)s。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your comments total %(words)s words; at least %(minimum)s are required."
msgstr "您的评语共 %(words)s 词；至少需要 %(minimum)s 词。"

msgid ""
"Explain the flag or referral in the notes: identify the passage(s) and your "
"reason."
msgstr "请在说明中解释您的标记或转交主席的原因：指出相关段落并说明理由。"

msgid "Tick the confirmation and type your name to sign the sheet."
msgstr "请勾选确认声明并输入姓名以签署评分表。"

msgid "Draft saved."
msgstr "草稿已保存。"

#, python-format
msgid "Your sheet for essay %(code)s has been submitted."
msgstr "您对文章 %(code)s 的评分表已提交。"

msgid "Please give a short reason for the committee chair."
msgstr "请向委员会主席简要说明理由。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Essay %(code)s has been returned to the committee chair for reassignment."
msgstr "文章 %(code)s 已退回委员会主席重新分配。"

#, python-format
msgid "Uploaded as %(code)s — ready for anonymization review."
msgstr "已上传，编号 %(code)s——等待匿名化审核。"

