msgstr "已上传，编号 %(code)s。另有一份上传文件与其同名，因此未关联作者信息——请在审核前手动填写作者信息。"

#, python-format
msgid "Stored as %(code)s, but it could not be processed: %(note)s"
msgstr "已保存，编号 %(code)s，但无法处理：%(note)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Skipped: identical to %(code)s, which is already in the portal."
msgstr "已跳过：与系统中已有的 %(code)s 完全相同。"

msgid "Only PDF files are accepted."
msgstr "仅接受 PDF 文件。"

#, python-format
msgid "File is larger than %(mb)s MB."
msgstr "文件超过 %(mb)s MB。"

msgid "The spreadsheet has no data rows."
msgstr "表格中没有数据行。"

msgid "Use a CSV or XLSX file for the author spreadsheet."
msgstr "作者信息表请使用 CSV 或 XLSX 文件。"

msgid "The spreadsheet could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取该表格。"

msgid "The spreadsheet is too large."
msgstr "表格过大。"

msgid "The spreadsheet needs a column named “filename”."
msgstr "表格需要包含名为“filename”的列。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s essay uploaded."
msgid_plural "%(n)s essays uploaded."
msgstr[0] "已上传 %(n)s 篇文章。"

msgid "Invalid request."
msgstr "请求无效。"

msgid "Choose a CSV or XLSX file first."
msgstr "请先选择 CSV 或 XLSX 文件。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(rows)s author records imported; %(matched)s matched essays already "
"uploaded (%(reprocessed)s re-redacted with the new details)."
msgstr ""
"已导入 %(rows)s 条作者信息；匹配到 %(matched)s 篇已上传的文章（其中 %(reprocessed)s 篇已根据新信息重新遮盖）。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"These file names belong to more than one author or more than one upload, so "
"no author record was attached automatically. Enter the details by hand on "
"each essay: %(names)s"
msgstr "以下文件名对应多位作者或多份上传文件，因此未自动关联作者信息。请在每篇文章中手动填写：%(names)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(n)s released essays were pulled back for review: the author details just "
"imported still appear in their text."
msgstr "已收回 %(n)s 篇已发放的文章重新审核：刚导入的作者信息仍出现在其文本中。"

msgid "The essay was pulled back from judges. Check it and release it again."
msgstr "文章已从评委处收回。请检查后重新发放。"

msgid "Essay details saved."
msgstr "文章信息已保存。"

msgid "Assignment removed. Any scores it held no longer count."
msgstr "分配已移除，其中的评分不再计入结果。"

msgid "This essay has assignments and cannot be deleted. Withdraw it instead."
msgstr "这篇文章已有分配记录，无法删除。请改为撤回。"

msgid "Essay deleted."
msgstr "文章已删除。"

msgid "Only essays released to judges can be assigned."
msgstr "只有已发放给评委的文章才能分配。"

